# Investigation: launched a read-only Explore agent across both repos
# (vitana-platform + vitana-v1) to map how "step"/"session" completion is
# signaled today, whether any tool/turn-count/phrase-detection mechanism
# marks guided-topic teaching as finished, and what could plausibly make
# mic/X-close unresponsive. Findings (full report kept in conversation, not
# duplicated here):
#
#  - GuidedJourneyCatalog.tsx opens the "Well done" drawer AT TAP TIME
#    (handleTopicClick -> setOpenTopic(topic)), mounted underneath the ORB
#    overlay for the whole session. It has no completion gate of its own —
#    visibility is purely a function of the ORB overlay's display:none.
#  - orb-widget.js's old guidedAutoClose (VTID-03292/03294) used to close
#    the overlay after turn 1 — removed by VTID-03685 because that fired
#    before real teaching happened. VTID-03685's own comment: "there is no
#    reliable signal yet for 'the model decided teaching is done' ...
#    guessing at one here would trade a definite bug for a fragile
#    heuristic" — a disclosed, still-open gap.
#  - guided-topic-narration-prompt.ts's GUIDE MODE block has no turn-count
#    limit or other exit condition, re-injected for the WHOLE session — so
#    once the model covers the material it free-wheels into ordinary
#    conversation. Matches the reported symptom.
#  - Working precedent already exists: Teacher Mode's end_teaching_session
#    tool (live-tool-catalog.ts / orb-live.ts) — model calls it after its
#    farewell line, server relays an orb_directive, widget closes overlay.
#    Never reused for guided topics.
#  - Topic completion (the checkmark) flows through completePractice() ->
#    completed_topic_ids, called from the EXISTING practice-drawer buttons
#    (openPracticeFeature / markPracticeDone) — unrelated to listening
#    itself. No auto-complete-on-listen mechanism was ever found to have
#    existed; the drawer's own header comment describes "Start Practice ->
#    real feature + completion" as a deliberate separate phase (P7).

# Fix: added end_guided_topic_teaching tool mirroring end_teaching_session
# exactly (live-tool-catalog.ts declaration, orb-live.ts dispatcher case,
# orb-widget.js directive handling), and instructed all four GUIDE MODE
# prompt variants (guided-topic-narration-prompt.ts) to call it once the
# topic is taught and follow-ups answered. Deliberately did NOT add a new
# DB write — the practice-drawer's existing completion flow is unchanged
# and becomes reachable again once the overlay actually closes.

